      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "\"Son, you have to see this not as malice, but as nature's design. Just as the mighty oak stands taller than the briar patch, each people has a station, and trying to shake that natural order is just tempting the storm. It ain't our choice; it's the grain of this land, the blueprint baked into the world itself. You serve that truth, and you serve your own peace.\"",
